# Dashboards

Role-scoped KPI / chart / queue surfaces. Mirror **`src/features/dashboard/`** (`/home` Command Center). Do not turn dashboards into list pages or settings hubs.

## Rules

- Hook → stateless page → thin route
- Aggregate reads in feature actions; scope by org / managed locations / self
- Mutations call the **owning** feature’s actions + shared modals, then reload
- Compose presentational widgets; feature skeleton while `!loaded`
- No `TablePageViewport` unless a section deliberately embeds a list (prefer linking out)

See `.docs/components/dashboards.md`.
